{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "picture-properties",
  "gate": "required",
  "operation": "picture-properties",
  "candidate": "codec-views-worker",
  "worker_operation": "picture-props-",
  "runner": "cargo xtask report",
  "reference": "ffmpeg-codec-views-native",
  "contract": [
    "Decode the elementary stream through the candidate decoders and the corresponding FFmpeg raw demuxer and decoder. Compare all pictures in decoder output order.",
    "Fold kind 4 with exact visible geometry from the conformance window, sample depth, plane count, reduced sample aspect ratio (0/0 for unspecified), CICP primaries, transfer and matrix, effective range, AVC coded-field status and a 16-byte MD5 of every visible plane. Apply the reference crop without alignment rounding.",
    "The AVC field value describes coding as separate fields, using the parser’s picture structure on the reference side. HEVC absent range implies narrow, as in Annex E. The reference has no equivalent coded VUI presence bits. A failed decode without any pictures folds kind 8. Decoding is timed by codec-workloads."
  ],
  "required_profiles": [
    "h264",
    "hevc"
  ],
  "required_targets": [
    "aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu",
    "thumbv7neon-unknown-linux-gnueabihf"
  ],
  "parity_timeout_seconds": 240,
  "iterations": 1,
  "minimum_pairs": 30,
  "confidence": 0.95,
